@base = http://127.0.0.1:8013/api/v1
@email = solicitante@example.test
@bearer = REEMPLAZAR_TOKEN_SANCTUM
@registrationCode = REEMPLAZAR_CODIGO_REGISTRO_DEL_CORREO
@recoveryCode = REEMPLAZAR_CODIGO_RECUPERACION_DEL_CORREO
@password = REEMPLAZAR_CONTRASENA_DE_PRUEBA
@newPassword = REEMPLAZAR_NUEVA_CONTRASENA_DE_PRUEBA

### Solicitar un código de registro
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### Confirmar usando el código recibido
POST {{base}}/auth/register/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","token":"{{registrationCode}}","name":"Solicitante de prueba","age":30,"gender":"Prefiero no decirlo","password":"{{password}}","password_confirmation":"{{password}}"}

### Inicio de sesión existente
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","device_name":"dispositivo de prueba"}

### Solicitar recuperación
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}"}

### Restablecer contraseña y revocar tokens
POST {{base}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","token":"{{recoveryCode}}","password":"{{newPassword}}","password_confirmation":"{{newPassword}}"}

### Consultar el perfil con un token vigente
GET {{base}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### Actualizar nombre
PATCH {{base}}/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Nombre nuevo de prueba"}

### Actualizar foto con una imagen sintética local
POST {{base}}/me/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=tekoraFixture

--tekoraFixture
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="sintetica.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./REEMPLAZAR_IMAGEN_SINTETICA.png
--tekoraFixture--

### Descargar la foto propia
GET {{base}}/me/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
